OL,3,GNEWSACalls to phase out plastics in
OL,4,Acemetery rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA south London council has rejected
OL,7,Fcalls to phase out plastics in one of
OL,8,Fits cemeteries, despite concerns that
OL,9,Fthey are creating a "massive
OL,10,Fenvironmental issue".
OL,12,FEcologist Alison Fure petitioned
OL,13,FKingston Council to better enforce the
OL,14,Fban on plastic decorative items at
OL,15,FKingston Cemetery, including ornaments,
OL,16,Fartificial flowers, pots, windmills and
OL,17,Fcellophane wrappers. It was signed by
OL,18,Fmore than 1,200 people.
OL,20,FIn a statement Fure said she hoped the
OL,21,Fcemetery could be restored to a "more
OL,22,Fnatural and respectful environment".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
