OL,3,GNEWSACalls to phase out plastics in
OL,4,Acemetery rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Andreas Kirsch said the
OL,7,Fcouncil would work with volunteers on
OL,8,Fthe issue, but said it had to balance
OL,9,Fprotecting the cemetery with the needs
OL,10,Fof bereaved families.
